      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashland_City%2C_Tennessee",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Montgomery Bell’s forge, established in 1818 at the Narrows of the Harpeth River, was the first major industry in the area.",
